Description: Local AI endpoint with an OpenAI-style API
 TokenStation runs GGUF language models on the GPU through Vulkan and
 serves them on your network with an OpenAI-style API. Built for a PS5
 running Linux, it works on any Linux machine with a Vulkan GPU.
